      <h1 class="jr-h1">Glutathione for Skin: Benefits, Dose and Honest Expectations</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">
        Glutathione is the most requested — and most oversold — ingredient in Indian skincare.
        A dermatologist on what oral glutathione actually does to pigmentation, the dose the
        trials used, and why the injectable version is a different conversation entirely.
      </p>

